@api = {{apiBase}}

### Begin TOTP enrollment
POST {{api}}/mfa/totp/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### Confirm TOTP and receive recovery codes
POST {{api}}/mfa/totp/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{totpCode}}"
}

### Disable TOTP (recent authentication required)
DELETE {{api}}/mfa/totp
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### Regenerate recovery codes (recent authentication required)
POST {{api}}/mfa/recovery-codes/regenerate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
